1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,679
The trial run was built around one task: take a recent proposal, roll it out for a week, and see what happens when people have to use it.

2
00:00:09,679 --> 00:00:16,960
A thin cup, a pale sheet of paper, and a musical recording were the only props.

3
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:22,255
“Let us combine the two strategies,” the coordinator said.

4
00:00:22,255 --> 00:00:27,706
“Connect the school to the shop and see what the child does.”

5
00:00:27,706 --> 00:00:35,862
An artist in the team wanted color; a democrat on the committee wanted advice from every acre of the district.

6
00:00:35,862 --> 00:00:44,958
“This is a raid, not a consultation,” the rebel said, and the spill of complaints that followed proved her right.

7
00:00:44,958 --> 00:00:54,719
The external review had a territorial clause, and a treaty of mutual assistance with another ward had never been signed.

8
00:00:54,719 --> 00:01:00,619
The pursuit of a breakthrough required a dose of patience and a ton of paperwork.

9
00:01:00,619 --> 00:01:21,037
“We must cooperate with the continental office,” the coordinator said, “or the completion date will move again.” A hectare of wheat, a manufacturer of agricultural tools, and a blend of two local dialects gave the trial its surprising harmony.

10
00:01:21,037 --> 00:01:24,077
The urgent part was the settlement.

11
00:01:24,077 --> 00:01:32,698
A bench, a roll of tape, and a written plan were all the team had; the rest was possession and hope.

12
00:01:32,698 --> 00:01:42,644
“Collaborate with the people who will be blamed if it fails,” Maya said, “and not only with the ones who will be praised.”

13
00:01:42,644 --> 00:01:51,020
The masterpiece they wanted was three lines long: what we did, what happened, what we will change.

14
00:01:51,020 --> 00:01:56,746
“A cent of honesty is worth a hundred tons of style,” Lin wrote.

15
00:01:56,746 --> 00:02:07,017
A forgery in the appendix nearly destroyed the whole document, and the strategic review that followed was more valuable than the launch.

16
00:02:07,017 --> 00:02:13,302
Back home, the information was harder to read like a story than like a table.

17
00:02:13,302 --> 00:02:18,138
“A woman in the queue asked me for help,” Maya said.

18
00:02:18,138 --> 00:02:31,884
“She did not ask for pay.” The business of the shop, the manufacture of a single bench, and the harmonious settlement of two complaints took the last three days of the trial.

19
00:02:31,884 --> 00:02:39,793
“Settle it with a word,” the coordinator said, “and do not make it a speech.”
